      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Further information on sector-specific requirements is available on our dedicated webpage.",
      "section": "Sectoral information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[7]/div/div/p[1]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0026"
    },
    {
      "text": "Explore CBAM Sectors",
      "section": "Sectoral information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[7]/div/div/p[2]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0027"
    },
    {
      "text": "Support for developing countries",
      "section": "Support for developing countries",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[7]/div/div/h2",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0028"
    },
    {
      "text": "The EU is committed to supporting developing countries and Least Developed Countries (LDCs) in greening their industries, transitioning to renewable energy sources and implementing CBAM. The EU is also committed to helping countries interested in introducing or enhancing their carbon pricing systems.",
      "section": "Support for developing countries",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[7]/div/div/p[3]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0029"
    },
    {
      "text": "The following document provides an overview of the guidance and technical support offered by the EU. It includes a list of programmes that support the green transition in developing countries and LDCs.",
      "section": "Support for developing countries",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[7]/div/div/p[4]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0030"
    },
    {
      "text": "More information",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[1]/h2",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0031"
    },
    {
      "text": "CBAM complements the EU Emissions Trading System (EU ETS) . It helps prevent carbon leakage by ensuring that imported goods reflect the carbon emissions generated during their production.",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[1]/div/div/p[1]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0032"
    },
    {
      "text": "In doing so, it supports the EU’s climate objectives , encourages cleaner industrial production in non-EU countries, and promotes global decarbonisation .",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[1]/div/div/p[2]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0033"
    },
    {
      "text": "CBAM covers",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[2]/div/div/p[1]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0034"
    },
