      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0039"
    },
    {
      "text": "hydrogen",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[2]/div/div/ul/li[6]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0040"
    },
    {
      "text": "The information on each sector is on the CBAM sectors page .",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[2]/div/div/p[2]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0041"
    },
    {
      "text": "The corrected default values are in the Default values definitive period (Excel format) .",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[3]/div/div/p[1]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0042"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can find more information on the CBAM Legislation and Guidance page.",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[3]/div/div/p[2]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0043"
    },
    {
      "text": "The CBAM declarant portal is established via UUM&DS portal.",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[4]/div/div/p[1]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0044"
    },
    {
      "text": "The manual for the declarant portal is CBAM UMN UI manual .",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[4]/div/div/p[2]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0045"
    },
    {
      "text": "For more information, visit the CBAM Registry and reporting page.",
      "section": "More information",
      "locator": "/html/body/div[2]/main/div/div[2]/div/div/article/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div[9]/div[2]/details[4]/div/div/p[3]",
      "block_id": "EU-CBAM-B0046"
    },
    {
      "text": "The prices are published each calendar quarter on the Price of CBAM certificates page.",
